alt=\"Apply Youth Face Beauty Cream\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;display:block;\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 14px 22px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05em;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:6px;\">Apply</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\">Take a small amount of <a href=\"/youth-face-beauty-cream/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;text-decoration:underline;\">Youth Face Beauty Cream</a> and apply it evenly to your face and neck.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px;\">\n<a href=\"/shop/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1a8a3f;color:#fff;padding:12px 30px;border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:0.9em;\">Buy Now</a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.6em;color:#1a5c33;margin:0 0 18px;\">Night Routine</h2>\n<div class=\"yf-htu-cards\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n<div class=\"yf-htu-card\">\n<img src=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/youth-face-routine-cleanse.jpg\" alt=\"Wash and dry your face\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;display:block;\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 14px 22px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05em;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:6px;\">Wash And Dry</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\">Wash your face to remove the day's dirt and oil, then pat dry.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yf-htu-card\">\n<img src=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/youth-face-routine-apply-cream.jpg\" alt=\"Apply Youth Face Beauty Cream at night\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;display:block;\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 14px 22px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05em;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:6px;\">Apply</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\">Apply Youth Face Beauty Cream evenly to your face 30 minutes before sleep.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yf-htu-card\">\n<img src=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/youth-face-routine-pat-dry.jpg\" alt=\"Wash your face in the morning\" style=\"width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;display:block;\">\n<div style=\"padding:16px 14px 22px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05em;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:6px;\">Wash</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\">Wash your face with water or a gentle cleanser the next morning.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\">\n<a href=\"/shop/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1a8a3f;color:#fff;padding:12px 30px;border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:0.9em;\">Buy Now</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Use Youth Face Beauty Cream\",\"description\":\"Day and night routine for applying Youth Face Beauty Cream with Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin.\",\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Wash\",\"text\":\"Wash your face with a gentle cleanser and lukewarm water.\",\"image\":\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/youth-face-routine-cleanse.jpg\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Dry\",\"text\":\"Pat dry your face with a clean towel, without rubbing.\",\"image\":\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/youth-face-routine-pat-dry.jpg\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Apply\",\"text\":\"Take a small amount of Youth Face Beauty Cream and apply it evenly to your face and neck, morning and night.\",\"image\":\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/youth-face-routine-apply-cream.jpg\"}]}</script>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e5e0d8;border-radius:12px;background:#faf6f2;text-align:center;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Mo